    "url": "%40CORIGI",
    "documentation": "$$$$ @CORIGI  NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:35     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n    Procedure @CORIGI            Voir aussi: @CLIM\n    \n    -----------------\n        \n        RIG1 = @CORIGI MAIL0;\n    \n    Auteurs:   L. GELEBART (CEA Saclay DEN/DMN/SRMA)\n    --------    \n    \n    Date :     09/2006\n    ------\n    \n    Exemple associe :     utilise par les procedures @CLIM\n    -----------------\n    \n    Contact :   lionel(dot)gelebart(at)cea(dot)fr\n    ---------\n    \n\n\n    Purpose :\n    ---------\n    This procedure allows to build the stiffness matrix\n    in order to avoid rigid body displacements.\n    \n    Comments :\n    --------------\n    MAIL0 : Periodic mesh defined in a square parallelepiped\n            volume (MAILLAGE)\n    RIG1  : Stiffness matrix (RIGIDITE)\n               \n    Remarques :\n    -----------\n       This procedure can be used for complex geometries for \n       which the avoiding ridi body dispalcement is not\n       straightforward.\n       \n \n \n"
