    "documentation": "$$$$ @LALIST  NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:51     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n    Procedure @LALIST                        Voir aussi : @LAREAD\n    -----------------  \n    @LALIST TAB_COMP ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    -------------\n\n    This procedure generates a list of characteristics of the\n    multilayers contained in the definition table, region after\n    region.\n\n    Input data :\n\n    TAB_COMP  characteristics table of the composite multilayers\n\n\n\n \n \n"
