    "url": "%40PARAMEC",
    "documentation": "$$$$ @PARAMEC NOTICE  FD218221  26/02/13    21:15:27     12462          \n                                             DATE     26/02/13\n\n    Procedure @PARAMEC\n    ------------------\n\n    Subject:\n    -------\n\n       This procedure is called by the PASAPAS/../PAS_MATE procedure\n    when using the BETON_THM model. It updates the material properties\n    as a function of the degree of hydration.\n\n$$$$\n \n"
