    "documentation": "$$$$ @RCCM    NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:52     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n \n  Procedure @RCCM                            Voir aussi :\n     ---------------  \n      \n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    SORRY ! this notice only exists in french. \n \n \n"
