    "documentation": "$$$$ ACOH     NOTICE  PASCAL    22/07/13    21:15:03     11409          \n                                             DATE     22/07/13\n\n      RESU1 = 'ACOH'  OBJET1 (MOT1) ;\n\n\n    Operator ACOH                            See also : COS SIN TAN\n    -------------                                         ACOS ASIN ATG  \n                                                          COSH SINH TANH  \n                                                               ASIH ATAH  \n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The ACOH operator calculates the reverse function of the hyperbolic \n    cosine  of the OBJET1 object.    \n    \n\n              -------------------------------------\n              |    OBJET1       |      RESU1      |\n              -------------------------------------\n              |    ENTIER       |    FLOTTANT     |\n              |    FLOTTANT     |    FLOTTANT     |\n              |    LISTENTI     |    LISTREEL     |\n              |    LISTREEL     |    LISTREEL     |\n              |    EVOLUTIO     |    EVOLUTIO     |\n              |    CHPOINT      |    CHPOINT      |\n              |    MCHAML       |    MCHAML       |\n              -------------------------------------\n      \n      \n    Remark :\n    _______\n    \n    In the case of an EVOLUTIO object, MOT1 indicates if the operation\n    is achieved on the abscissa ('ABSC' key-word) or on the ordinates\n    ('ORDO' key-word, by default).\n\n$$$$ \n \n"
