    "url": "AFFICHE",
    "documentation": "$$$$ AFFICHE  NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:04     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n    Procedure AFFICHE                        Voir aussi : DESS\n    -----------------                                     TRAC  \n    AFFICHE  RIG1 CHPO1 GEO1 FLOT1 FLOT2 ;\n    \n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    This procedure displays, on the screen, the deformed shape \n  of a structure subjected to a given loading.\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    RIG1  : structure stiffness matrix (RIGIDITE type)\n\n    CHPO1 : structure loading (CHPOINT type)\n\n    GEO1  : structure mesh (MAILLAGE type)\n\n    FLOT1 : coefficient of amplification of the deformed shape\n            (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT2 : coefficient of amplification of the vectors \n            representing the loading (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    Note :\n    ________\n\n    The operands must be input in the order indicated by the \n syntax.\n\n \n"
