    "name": "AIDE",
    "url": "AIDE",
    "documentation": "$$$$ AIDE     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:05     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n  Operateur AIDE                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------                             \n      LISMO1  =  AIDE  MOT1 ;\n\n\nANGL====*****************************************************\nKEY-WORDS :  INDEX   KEY-WORDS  SEARCH DICTIONNARY\nANGL====***************************************************                 \n\n \n Description : \n _____________\n    \n   The AIDE (help) operator searches in the user's manual,\n all the operators with the string MOT1 in its list of key words.\n The list is printed if it is not empty and a LISTMOTS type\n object is created.\n   MOT1 must be a capital-letter string.\n\n \n"
