    "documentation": "$$$$ AJU2     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/14    21:15:01     7129           \n                                             DATE     11/09/14\n\n  Operateur AJU2                            Voir aussi :\n    --------------                          \n\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    This operator is called by the AJUSTE procedure.\n\n\n \n\n \n \n"
