    "documentation": "$$$$ ANGL     NOTICE  GOUNAND   26/09/03    21:15:06     12637          \n                                             DATE     26/09/03\n\n    Operator ANGLE                            See also : TOUR\n    --------------  \n    FLOT1 = ANGL  VEC1 VEC2 (VEC3) ;\n\n    Description :\n    ___________\n\n     This operator computes the angle between two vectors or the solid\n     angle defined by three vectors.\n\n    Contents :\n    _________\n\n      VECi  : vectors (POINT type)\n\n      FLOT1 : angle (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    Remarks :\n    _________\n\n     1) Angle's unit is degree and solid angle's is steradian\n\n     2) In 2D, the angle is signed, positive anti-clockwise\n\n     3) Angle values are in range [0. ,180.] ( ]-180. ,180.] in 2D).\n \n"
