    "url": "ANIME",
    "documentation": "$$$$ ANIME    NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:07     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n    Procedure ANIME                          Voir aussi : TRAC\n    ---------------  \n    DEFO1 = ANIME  N1 GEO1 CHPO1 FLOT1 (CHPO2 FLOT2 (COUL1))...\n            ... | CHPO3\n                | CHEL MODE   ; \n                                                            \n;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The ANIME procedure constructs a DEFORME type object which\n is intended to be displayed in animation by means of the options\n ANIME and OSCIL of the TRAC operator.\n\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    N1    : number of deformed shapes (number of images) to be\n            created (ENTIER type)\n\n    GEO1  : mesh to be represented (MAILLAGE type)\n\n    CHPO1 : displacement field to be represented (CHPOINT\n            type)\n\n    FLOT1 : coefficient of amplification of the displacement \n            field (FLOTTANT type)    \n\n    CHPO2 : possible field of vector-forces to be plotted\n            (CHPOINT type)\n\n    FLOT2 : coefficient of amplification of the force field \n            (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    COUL1 : color of the force field (MOT type)\n\n    CHPO3 : scalar field to show isovalue. (CHPOINT type)\n \n    CHEL  : scalar field to show isovalue. (MCHAML type)\n\n    MODE  : associated model \n \n \n"
