    "name": "BIOVOL",
    "url": "BIOVOL",
    "documentation": "$$$$ BIOVOL   NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:13     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure BIOVOL                           Voir aussi :\n        -----------------  \n             CHP1 = BIOVOL GEO1 GEO2 CHP2 FLOT1 \n\n\n\n        Description :\n        ------------\n\n        Calculation of the magnetic field by means of BIOT ET SAVART,\n        by integration on elements of any form.\n\n        Contents :\n        ----------\n \n           GEO1   inductor mesh \n           GEO2   mesh on which the field is calculated\n           CHP2   chpoint of the densities of electric current on GEO1\n                  (JX JY JZ) can be obtained by calling on COUR3D\n\n        output data :\n\n           CHP1   chpoint of induction on GEO2  (BX BY BZ) \n\n \n"
