    "url": "CALLM",
    "documentation": "$$$$ CALLM    NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:16     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                                                                \n    Procedure CALLM                          Voir aussi : ENCEINTE\n    ---------------                                       CALMU  \n    Lmh2 Lmhe Lmo2 Lmn2 Lmco2 Lmco Lmvap Lmair = CALLM T ;\n\n\n                                                                                \n                                                                                \n     Description :\n     _____________\n\n CALMU computes the thermal conductivity at a given temperature\n for the following gazes : H2, He, 02, N2, CO2, CO, H2Osteam, Air.\n\n     Comments :\n     __________\n\n      T    : is the temperature in Kelvin\n             and can be either CHPOINT or FLOTTANT or LISTREEL.\n      Lmi  : is the thermal conductivity in W/m/K\n             and has the same type as the input temperature.\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n"
