    "documentation": "$$$$ CHAMINT  NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:21     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Operatueur CHAMINT                           Voir aussi :\n    ------------------  \n    CH2 xstart = CHAMINT CH1 ;\n\n\n \n     USED BY TRANSGEN - NOT FOR USERS\n\n    CH1      chargement\n    \n    CH2      chargement CH1 - time integrated\n\n    xstart   time value above which\n             the CHARGEMENT is constant. \n             Prevents calling TIRE too often.\n\n \n \n"
