    "documentation": "$$$$ CHDCLIM  NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:23     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n     Methode CHDCLIM                         Voir aussi : METH CHANOLII\n     ---------------                                      OBJE  CH2CLIM  \n      OBJ1 = OBJET CHDCLIM ;\n\n\n        Description\n        -----------\n\n    The method CHDCLIM  define an object which classe is CHDCLIM.\n    The elements of an CHDCLIM object are words defined by the user.\n    Associated method:  GDCLIM.\n             call : OBJ1%GDCLIM MOT1 LENT1 ;\n \n"
