    "documentation": "$$$$ CHOI     NOTICE  OF166741  24/01/09    21:15:06     9733           \n                                             DATE     24/01/09\n                                             \n  Operateur CHOI                             Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    LOG1 ... LOGn = CHOI CHAINE BOOL1 ... BOOLn ;\n\n\n    Description:\n    ____________\n\n    The CHOI operator allow to choose graphically options in a set\n    of options shown as a scoreboard.\n\n    CHAINE : character string written on the screen\n\n   BOOL1   : logical whose name is written on the screen following\n   ...       (X) if TRUE et ( ) if FALSE\n   BOOLn\n\n   LOG1    : logical set as TRUE if the option is selected and \n   ...       FALSE in the other case\n   LOGn\n\n\n    Comment:\n    ________\n\n    In non-interactive mode (neither X nor OPEN), each output LOGi \n    logical is equal to the corresponding input BOOLi logical.\n\n \n"
