    "name": "CHSP",
    "url": "CHSP",
    "documentation": "$$$$ CHSP     NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:04     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n                                             \n  Operateur CHSP                                 Voir aussi :\n    ---------------  \n    EVOL2 = CHSP  EVOL1 'ENTR' MOT1 'SORT' MOT2 ('COUL' COUL1);\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    This operator makes it possible to turn one (or several) given\n spectrum (spectra) into one (or several) spectrum (spectra) of a\n different type.\n\n    Contents :\n    _________\n\n\n    EVOL1  : spectrum (spectra) that the user wishes to modify\n             (EVOLUTION type)\n\n    'ENTR' : key word followed by :\n\n    MOT1   : type of input spectrum (spectra) chosen from :\n             'DEPL', 'VITE' or 'ACCE'\n\n    'SORT' : key word followed by :\n\n    MOT2   : type of output spectrum (spectra) chosen from :\n             'DEPL', 'VITE' or 'ACCE'\n\n    'COUL' : optional key word followed by :\n\n    COUL1  : color requested for the curves (MOT type)\n\n    EVOL2  : generated spectrum (EVOLUTION type)\n\n \n \n"
