    "name": "COAC",
    "url": "COAC",
    "documentation": "$$$$ COAC     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:30     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  \n  Operateur COAC                            Voir aussi :\n   --------------  \n       CHPO3 = COAC  TAB1  'FORCEION' CHPO1  < 'TEMPERAT' CHPO2 >   ;\n\n\n     Description :\n     -------------\n     The COAC operator allow the calculation of activity coefficient\n      in aqueous systems.\n\n     Contents:\n     ---------\n\n       TAB1 is a TABLE type object, subtype CHIMI1. (cf operator CHI1)\n\n\n       'FORCEION' key word\n\n       CHPO1 is a CHPOIN type object. Scalar at nodes. Contains\n             the value of ionic strength.\n\n       'TEMPERAT' key word\n\n       CHPO2 is a CHPOIN type object. The temperature in degrees\n             Celsius\n\n       CHPO3 is a CHPOIN type object. Scalar at nodes. Contains\n             the values of activity coefficient.\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n"
