    "documentation": "$$$$ CONF     NOTICE  MB234859  25/03/07    17:07:21     12174          \n                                             DATE     25/03/07\n                                             \n    Operateur CONF                           Voir aussi : CAPI\n    --------------                                        FORM  \n    RES1 (RES2 ... RESN) =  CONF MODL1 CH1 (CH2 ... CHN) ;\n                \n                \n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The CONF operator transports a stress, strain, or caracteristics field   \n    defined on another configuration on the current configuration\n      \n   Comment :\n   _________\n\n   MODL1: object of MMODEL type.\n\n   For i = 1 to N\n   CHi  : Stress, strain, or caracteristics field before transport   \n          (MCHAML type, CONTRAINTES/DEFORMATIONS/CARACTERISTIQUES subtype)\n\n   RESi : Stress, strain, or caracteristics field after transport   \n          (MCHAML type, CONTRAINTES/DEFORMATIONS/CARACTERISTIQUES subtype)\n\n   Remarks:\n   _____________\n\n   The use of a field defined on a configuration different of the current\n   configuration is generally prohibited.\n   Several fields can be supplied to the operator.\n\n$$$$\n \n \n"
