    "documentation": "$$$$ COUR3D   NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:38     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure COUR3D                      Voir aussi :\n        ----------------  \n        CHP1 = COUR3D GEO1  GEO2 GEO3  MOT1 FLOT1  (LOG1 ) \n\n\n\n       Description :\n       -------------\n\n       Calculation of the electric currents in a 3d-mesh inductor.\n        \n       Contents :\n       ----------\n\n        GEO1    inductor mesh (3d solid)\n        GEO2    mesh of the electric current output section \n        GEO3    mesh of the electric current input section\n        MOT1    word 'AMP' or 'AT' \n        FLOT1   floating, current density if  mot1 = AMP\n                         total amperes if mot1 = AT \n        LOG1    logical with true value if the current density in\n                the curvature radii is adjusted\n\n        output data :\n\n        CHP1  chpoint of the electric current densities on GEO1\n              ( JX JY JZ ) \n\n \n"
