    "name": "DEBI",
    "url": "DEBI",
    "documentation": "$$$$ DEBI     NOTICE  AM        20/05/11    21:15:01     10610          \n                                             DATE     20/05/11\n                                             \n  Operateur DEBIT                           Voir aussi :\n    ---------------  \n      CHPO2 = DEBIT  MODL1 | FLOT1 GEO1 |  ( MOT1) ;\n                           | CHPO1      |\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    This operator makes it possible to calculate the nodal values\nequivalent to a flow (per unit line in 2D or per unit surface in 3D)\ncondition imposed on a boundary of a porous medium.\n\n      Contents :\n      __________\n\n\n        MODL1 : solid object, on the boundary of which a flow\n                condition is imposed (MMODEL type)\n\n        FLOT1 : algebraic value of the imposed flow (FLOTTANT type)\n\n        GEO1  : object (line in 2D, surface in 3D), onto which\n                the flow condition is applied (MAILLAGE type)\n\n        CHPO1 : equivalent nodal values (CHPOINT type)\n\n        MOT1  : name given to the result (by defect, taken from the model)\n\n        CHPO2 : equivalent nodal flux (CHPOINT type)\n\n\n \n \n \n \n"
