    "url": "DEBU",
    "documentation": "$$$$ DEBU     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:45     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n  Voir aussi :\n For general information about GIBI, enter INFO GIBI;\n\n For specific information about a particular operator, enter INFO\n (operator name) ;\n \n For an example of use, enter INFO EXEMPLE;\n\n The detailed operators are listed below :\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| General operators :                                               |\n| OPTI  FIN   TITR  COMM  OUBL  MANU  DENS  TASS                    |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Inputs-outputs :                                                  |\n| LIST  TRAC  SORT  LIRE                                            |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Interactive mesh adjustment :                                     |\n| MODI                                                              |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Creation of logicals :                                            |\n| <     >     <EG   >EG   EG    NEG   ET    OU    NON               |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Creation of words  :                                              |\n| MOT                                                               |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Creation of numbers :                                             |\n| DENS  NBEL  NBNO  COOR  NORM  +     -     *     /     **          |\n| EXP   LOG   ENTI  FLOT  PSCA  PMIX  SIN   COS   ATG   ABS         |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Creation of points :                                              |\n| DIGI  NOEU  POIN  CONF  BARY PVEC  *     /                        |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Creation of lines :                                               |\n| DROI  CERC  PARA  INTE  COTE  CONT  COMP  QUEL  CER3  CUBP  CUBT  |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Creation of surfaces :                                            |\n| SURF  DALL  TRAN  ROTA  INCL  ORIE  RACC  FACE  LIAI  REGL  COUT  |\n| ENVE  GENE  REGE                                                  |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Creation of volumes :                                             |\n| PAVE  VOLU  REGE                                                  |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Geometrical operations :                                          |\n| ET    CHAN  INVE  PLUS  MOIN  HOMO  TOUR  AFFI  SYME  ELIM  DIFF  |\n| DEPL  PROJ  ELEM  ORIE  VERS  INTE                                |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Vectorial calculation :                                           |\n| PLUS  MOIN  *     /     PSCA  PVEC  PMIX                          |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Test loop procedure and dialogue :                                |\n| SI    SINO  FINS  REPE  QUIT  FIN   DEBP  FINP  OBTE  MESS  TEXT  |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n| Colors management :                                               |\n| COUL                                                              |\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n \n \n"
