    "documentation": "$$$$ DEDUADAP NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:47     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n\n    Procedure DEDUADAP                      See also : DEDU\n    ------------------                                 \n    Description :\n    ___________\n\n    This procedure solves the nonlinear optimization problem\n    arising in the algorithm used by the 'DEDU' operator with\n    the 'ADAP' option.\n\n    Go to the 'DEDU' manual page.\n\n \n \n"
