    "documentation": "$$$$ DESCOUR  NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:50     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure DESCOUR                    Voir aussi :\n        -----------------  \n        DESCOUR TAB1  ENT1  GEO1  MOT1   FLOT1 \n \n\n\n        Description  :\n        --------------\n \n        Description of regions of electric current in vector potential\n        magnetostatics.\n\n        Contents :\n        ----------\n\n        TAB1   TABLE which will contain the description of regions \n               of electric current \n        ENT1   rank of the described region\n        GEO1   mesh of the region of ENT1 rank\n        MOT1   word equal to 'AMP' or 'AT' or 'FIL' \n        FLOT1  electric current density floating J (AMP) or number of \n               total amperes (AT) or amperes by points (FIL)\n               in the last case, Geo1 is of POI1 mesh type \n\n               You will run through DESCOUR as many times as there\n               are distinct regions of electric current.             \n\n\n \n"
