    "url": "DIME",
    "documentation": "$$$$ DIME     NOTICE  CB215821  22/09/20    21:15:03     11459          \n                                             DATE     22/09/20\n\n    Operateur DIMENSION                      Voir aussi : DIMN\n    -------------------  \n    ENTI1 = DIMENSION OBJET1 (MOT);\n                                   OBJET1=LISTREEL,LISTENTI,LISTMOTS\n                                          LISTCHPO,EVOLUTIO,RIGIDITE\n                                          SOLUTION,TABLE   ,CHARGEME\n                                          NUAGE\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The DIMENSION operator supplies the ENTI1 dimension (ENTIER type)\n    of an OBJET1 object.\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n\n______________________________________________________________\n|  OBJET1  |  Subtype    |            Meaning                |\n|----------|-------------|-----------------------------------|\n| MOT      |             |  number of characters             |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| LISTREEL |             |  number of FLOTTANTs              |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| LISTENTI |             |  number of ENTIERs                |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| LISTMOTS |             |  number of MOTs                   |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| LISTCHPO |             |  number of CHPOINTs               |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| LISTOBJE |             |  number of OBJETS                 |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| EVOLUTION|             |  number of curves                 |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n|          |             |  number of unknowns for the       |\n| RIGIDITE |             |  associated physical problem      |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n|          |   MODE      |  number of modes                  |\n|          |_____________|___________________________________|\n| SOLUTION |  SOLUSTAT   |  number of static solutions       |\n|          |_____________|___________________________________|\n|          |  DYNAMIQUE  |  number of time steps             |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| TABLE    |             |  number of objects                |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n| CHARGEME |             |  number of objects                |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n|          |   'COMP'    |  nombre of variable (components)  |\n| NUAGE    |   'UPLE'    |  nombre of uplets (elements)      |\n|__________|_____________|___________________________________|\n\n\n$$$$ \n"
