    "documentation": "$$$$ DYNAMOD2 NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:09     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n\n    Procedure DYNAMOD2                       Voir aussi : DYNAMOD3\n    ------------------                                    DYNAMODE  \n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n   This procedure is used by the DYNAMODE procedure.\n\n \n \n"
