    "name": "ECHIMP",
    "url": "ECHIMP",
    "documentation": "$$$$ ECHIMP   NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:15:58     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Operateur  ECHIMP                       Voir aussi :\n     -----------------  \n\n\n\n\n    APPLICATION FIELD : Thermo-hydraulic.\n    ------------------\n                      \n     \n     DESCRIPTION :   Impose the thermal exchanges through a mesh object of\n     -------------   the domain of calculation \n\n\n      SYNTAX :   'ZONE' $DOM 'OPER' ECHIMP H TETA 'INCO' TN\n     ---------\n\n\n     POSSIBLES TABLES :\n     -----------------    \n\n  H      Heat Exchange coefficient               CHPOINT SCAL CENTRE  \n\n\n  TETA   Wall Temperature                        CHPOINT SCAL CENTRE\n\n\n\n \n"
