    "documentation": "$$$$ ENER     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:02     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur ENER                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n      CHAM3  =  ENER  MOD1 CHAM1  CHAM2  ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The ENER operator calculates the tensorial product of a stress\n    field and a strain field.\n    The result is a scalar field standing for energy density.\n   \n\n      Contents :\n      __________\n\n\n       MOD1  :  model object (MMODEL type)\n\n       CHAM1 :  MCHAML type object of CONTRAINTES or DEFORMATIONS\n                subtype\n\n       CHAM2 :  MCHAML type object of CONTRAINTES or DEFORMATIONS\n                subtype\n\n       CHAM3 :  MCHAML type object, of SCALAIRE subtype\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n"
