    "name": "EQUI",
    "url": "EQUI",
    "documentation": "$$$$ EQUI     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:04     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n\n    Operateur EQUI                           Voir aussi : KABL PREC\n    --------------                                        PROI  \n\n      RIG1    =  EQUI 'RIGI' MODBET MODCAB MAT1   ;\n\n      CHPO1   =  EQUI 'FORCES' MODBET MODCAB SIG1 ;\n\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The operator EQUI calculates the stiffness of tendons or the forces\n    equivalent to prestresses expressed at the nodes of the concrete.\n\n\n      Comments :\n      __________\n\n      'RIGI'   : key word to indicate that the calculation of the tendons\n                 to the stiffness is required.\n\n      'FORCES' : key word to indicate that the calculation of the equivalent\n                 forces is required.\n\n      MODBET   : model object associated to concrete (MMODEL type)\n\n      MODCAB   : model object associated to tendons (MMODEL type)\n\n      MAT1     : field of material properties of concrete and tendons\n                 (MCHAML type, CARACTERISTIQUES subtype)\n\n      RIG1     : stiffness matrices\n                 (RIGIDITE type , RIGIDITE subtype)\n\n      SIG1     : stress field (MCHAML type, CONTRAINTES subtype)\n\n      CHPO1    : forces field (CHPOINT type)\n\n \n \n \n"
