    "name": "ERFC",
    "url": "ERFC",
    "documentation": "$$$$ ERFC     NOTICE  PASCAL    22/07/13    21:15:05     11409          \n                                             DATE     22/07/13\n\n      RESU1 = 'ERFC'  OBJET1 (MOT1) ;\n\n\n    Operator ERFC                            See also : ERF\n    ------------  \n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The ERFC operator calculates the Gauss complementary error function\n    of the object OBJET1. \n    \n      ERFC(X) = 1 - ERF(X)\n\n              -------------------------------------\n              |    OBJET1       |      RESU1      |\n              -------------------------------------\n              |    ENTIER       |    FLOTTANT     |\n              |    FLOTTANT     |    FLOTTANT     |\n              |    LISTENTI     |    LISTREEL     |\n              |    LISTREEL     |    LISTREEL     |\n              |    CHPOINT      |    CHPOINT      |\n              |    MCHAML       |    MCHAML       |\n              -------------------------------------\n      \n      \n    Remark :\n    _______\n    \n    In the case of an EVOLUTIO object, MOT1 indicates if the operation\n    is achieved on the abscissa ('ABSC' key-word) or on the ordinates\n    ('ORDO' key-word, by default).\n \n \n$$$$ \n \n"
