    "name": "ETG",
    "url": "ETG",
    "documentation": "$$$$ ETG      NOTICE  GOUNAND   25/05/06    21:15:02     12261          \n                                             DATE     25/05/06\n\n\n    Operator  ETG                           See also : ET TABL PART\n    -------------                                      ENUM  \n\n\n    OBJET2 = 'ETG'  ( TAB1  )  ;\n                    ( LOBJ1 )\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The ETG operator constructs the OBJET2 object which results from\n    the fusion ('ET' operator) of all the objects stored in:\n    - either the table TAB1 with 'SOUSTYPE' 'ESCLAVE' ;\n    - or the list of objects LOBJ1.\n\n    Table TAB1 may only contain objects of type:\n    'CHPOINT' , 'RIGIDITE', 'LOGIQUE' , 'MCHAML', 'MMODEL', 'MAILLAGE',\n    'MATRIK'  , 'FLOTTANT', 'EVOLUTIO', 'ENTIER', 'MOT'   , 'CHARGEME',\n    'LISTREEL', 'LISTENTI', 'LISTMOTS', 'POINT'.\n\n    The list of objects LOBJ1 may only contain objects of type:\n    'CHPOINT' , 'RIGIDITE', 'MCHAML',  'MMODEL',   'MAILLAGE', 'MATRIK',\n    'EVOLUTIO', 'ENTIER'  , 'CHARGEME','LISTREEL', 'LISTENTI',\n    'LISTMOTS', 'POINT'.\n\n\n\n$$$$\n \n"
