    "documentation": "$$$$ FACTORIE NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:10     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Procedure FACTORIE                       Voir aussi :\n    ------------------  \n    ENTI1 = FACTORIE ENTI2 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    This procedure calculates the factorial of an integer.\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    ENTI2 : number the factorial of which is requested (ENTIER type)\n\n    ENTI1 : factorial of the ENTI2 number (ENTIER type)\n\n \n"
