    "documentation": "$$$$ FANT     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:10     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Directive FANTOME                        Voir aussi :   \n    -----------------                                       \n          FANTOME TAB1  INDICE1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The FANTOME (ghost) directive allows to give the type FANTOME to an object \npertaining to a table. This needs that the object has been already written by th\ndirective SAUVER (save).\n\n    The purpose of this is to be able to free the memoryspace used by this objec\n\n    Comments :\n    _________\n\n       TAB1    is the TABLE object\n      \n       INDICE1 is the index of the object to make disappear  \n \n"
