    "documentation": "$$$$ FION     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:13     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n  \n  Operateur FION                            Voir aussi :\n   --------------  \n       CHPO2 = FION  TAB1  CHPO1  ;\n\n\n     Description :\n     -------------\n     The FION operator allow the calculation of ionic strength\n      in aqueous systems.\n\n     Contents:\n     ---------\n\n       TAB1 is a TABLE type object, subtype CHIMI1. (cf operator CHI1)\n\n\n       CHPO1 is a CHPOIN type object. Contains a component for each\n             soluble chemical species. Contains the species \n             concentration in solution.\n\n       CHPO2 is a CHPOIN type object. Contains the value of ionic\n             strength.\n \n \n"
