    "url": "FIXHC",
    "documentation": "$$$$ FIXHC    NOTICE  BR232186  16/12/05    21:39:28     9238           \n                                             DATE     16/12/05\n\n\n    Procedure FIXHC   \n    ------------------\n\n\n\n    This procedure is invoked by PASAPAS. It creates an elements \n    field which ensure the geometrical continuity of the crack \n    path when the problem is solved out by the E-FEM method. The \n    geometrical continuity is ensured by solving a conduction-\n    like problem at the end of each time step.    \n    \n    \n  \n \n \n \n"
