    "documentation": "$$$$ FONC     NOTICE  CB215821  23/10/18    21:15:05     11760          \n                                             DATE     23/10/18\n\n  Operateur FONC                           Voir aussi :\n    ---------------  \n      LREEL1 = FONC | 'FRESNEL' | 'CX' | LREEL2 ;\n                    |           | 'SX' |\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The FONC operator enables the calculation of Fresnel integrals \n    using the Lanczos method :\n    splitting the space of integration into two domains (x<4 and x>4)\n\n    Contents :\n    ----------\n\n   'CX'    : cosine integral \n                               / x\n             F = 1/sqrt(2.PI) /    cos(t)/sqrt(t) dt\n                             / 0\n\n   'SX'    : sine integral \n                               / x\n             F = 1/sqrt(2.PI) /    sin(t)/sqrt(t) dt\n                             / 0\n\n    LREEL2 : variable values (LISTREEL type)\n\n    LREEL1 : function values (LISTREEL type)\n\n$$$$\n \n"
