    "documentation": "$$$$ FOUR2TRI NOTICE  BP208322  21/01/28    21:15:07     10868          \n                                             DATE     21/01/28\n\nProcedure FOUR2TRI:            Voir aussi : POUT2MAS, CREER3D\n      FOUR2TRI TAB1 (NUMFOUR);\n\n\n\nDescription:\n------------\n\n      FOUR2TRI generates a 3D mesh correponding to a 2D Fourier model\n      or a 2D mesh.\n      If 2D Fourier fields (displacements, forces, scalar) are given,\n      then equivalent 3D fields are built on the 3D mesh.\n      The table TAB1 can be used for successive calls to FOUR2TRI.\n      This way of doing may be useful to recombine several Fourier\n      harmonics contribution.\n\n      \nInput:\n------\n\n     NUMFOUR : (ENTIER) Fourier harmonic number on which are defined the \n               2D fields to transfer toward 3D mesh.\n               \n     TAB1    : (TABLE) with the following index:\n     \n       . 'MODELE' : (MMODEL) 2D Fourier model\n     ou\n       . 'MAILLAGE' : (MAILLAGE) 2D mesh\n       \n       . 'ANGLES'   : (LISTREEL optional) angular discretisation for  \n                       the 3D mesh (= prog 0. 15. 360. by default)\n       \n       . 'REDRESSE' : (LOGIQUE optional) change of frame to align the\n                      z et Z axes (FAUX by default) so that :\n                       = | FAUX --> (r,\\theta,z)_{2D} = (X,-Z,Y)_{3D}\n                         | VRAI --> (r,\\theta,z)_{2D} = (X,Y,Z)_{3D}\n                        \n       . 'ELIM' : (FLOTTANT optional) tolerance for the callings to the\n                   operators ELIM, MASQ et IPOL (=1.E-12 by default)\n       \n       . |'DEPLACEMENTS' | : (TABLE optional) indexed with i=1..n\n         |'EFFORTS'      |\n         |'CHPO_SYME'    |\n         |'CHPO_ANTI'    |\n                     . i : (CHPOINT) 2D Fourier field to transfer\n\n\nOutput:\n-------\n     The indexes added to TAB1 are:\n\n       . 'MAILLAGE_3D' : (MAILLAGE) 3D mesh obtained by rotation \n                         (via ROTA or VOLU 'ROTA')\n                         \n       . 'ANGLE_3D'    : (CHPOINT) \\theta angle on the 3D mesh\n       \n       . 'COORDONNEES_2D' : (CHPOINT) coordinates (r,z) of the 2D mesh\n       \n       . 'COORDONNEES_3D' : (CHPOINT) coordinates (r,z) of the 3D mesh\n       \n       . |'DEPLACEMENTS_3D' | : (TABLE) indexed with i=1..n\n         |'EFFORTS_3D'      |\n         |'CHPO_SYME_3D'    |\n         |'CHPO_ANTI_3D'    |\n                     . i : (CHPOINT) 3D field \n\n\n$$$$\n\n \n"
