    "documentation": "$$$$ FREN     NOTICE  JB251061  21/12/07    21:15:02     11213          \n                                             DATE     21/12/07\n\n  Operateur FRENET                         Voir aussi :\n    ----------------  \n    CHPO1 = FREN LIG1 ;\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The FRENET operator constructs the Frenet frame of a mesh LIG1 made up of\n    either SEG2 or SEG3 elements.\n\n    Comment :\n    _________\n\n    LIG1   : curve whose Frenet frame is sought (MAILLAGE type)\n\n    CHPO1  : Frenet frame (CHPOINT type), the tangent being defined by the\n    components TX, TY (and TZ in 3D), the normal by the components NX, NY\n    (and NZ in 3D) and the binormal by the components BX, BY (and BZ in 3D)\n\n    Remark : the curve LIG1 may not be connected, but each of its connected\n    component must be correctly oriented.\n    \n    Remark : when the curve is open, the tangent at each endpoint is determined\n    using the direction of the corresponding segment. In 3D, the binormal is\n    determined from the one computed at the adjacent point by the Gram-Schmidt\n    process, and the normal follows. The frame is thus less accurate at the\n    endpoints.\n\n$$$$ \n"
