    "documentation": "$$$$ FTRAN    NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:12     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n\n\n    Operateur FTRAN                       Voir aussi : FILC\n    --------------  \n   EV3 = FTRAN EV1 EV2 F0 VAL1;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The FTRAN procedure computes the transfer function between\n    two signals EV1 and EV2\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    EV1   : first signal (EVOLUTION type)\n    EV2   : second signal (type EVOLUTION type)\n    F0    : frequency cut-off (FLOTTANT type)\n    VAL1  : number of points erased at the beginning and\n            the end of frequency domain (ENTIER type)\n    EV3   : transfert function (module et phase) \n                               (type EVOLUTION type)        \n            EV3 = TFR(EV1)/TFR(EV2)\n\n\n \n \n \n"
