    "documentation": "$$$$ GENJ     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:23     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur GENJ                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    GEO2 = GENJ GEO1 FLOT1;\n \n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n \n    The GENJ operator generates a mesh GEO2 (MAILLAGE type) of interface\nelements connecting the internal contours of the mesh GEO1 (MAILLAGE\ntype). FLOT1 (FLOTTANT type) indicates the distance used in order to\ncheck the vicinity of two points.\n \n    Note :\n    ________\n \n    In 2D, GENJ generates element of the type JOI2 from mesh of TRI3 \nand/or QUA4. In 3D, the interface elements are of the type JOT3 and/or\nJOI4, starting from CUB8, PRI6, PYR5 and/or TET4.\n \n \n"
