    "documentation": "$$$$ G_ULTI2D NOTICE  AF221230  16/11/03    21:15:03     9139           \n                                             DATE     16/11/03\n\n    procedure G_ULTI2D                       Voir aussi : MRCSHELL\n    ----------------  \n   VAL1 = G_ULTI2D TAB1;\n\n\n\nDescription :\n-------------\n\n    Function to determinate the position of the actual stress\n    with respect to the limit surface for the three layer model of MARTI \n    (see EFFMARTI). The output of the procedure is the controm value \n    VAL1. If VAL1<0 S is outside of the limit surface domain\n             VAL1>0 S is inside of the limit surface domain\n\nComments :\n----------\n\nThis procedure is used for the procedure of safety margin for 2D\nelements (walls and slabs) - see MRCSHELL\n\nInput data :\n-----------\n\n\nOutput data :\n-------------\n\n                   \nNote :\n--------\n\n\n$$$$\n\n\n\n\n\n \n"
