    "documentation": "$$$$ HANN     NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:13     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n                                             \n  Operateur HANN                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    EVOL1 = HANN EVOL2 N1 (COUL1);\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The HANN operator works out Hanning mean for the spectrum EVOL2\n    according to the N1 number of iterations of Hanning (application \n    of Tuckey coefficients 1/4,1/2,1/4). The resulting spectrum EVOL1 \n    has the same title as EVOL2 prefixed by 'HANNING (N1 value)', as\n    well as the same color, except when the latter is specified by COUL1\n    in option.\n\n    Caution :\n    _________\n\n    EVOL1 and (implicitely) EVOL2 have a single curve.\n\n    EVOL2 may be destructed without modifying EVOL1.\n\n\n \n \n"
