    "documentation": "$$$$ HAUBAN   NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:26     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure HAUBAN                         Voir aussi :\n    ----------------  \n    GEO1 MODL1 CHEL1 =  HAUBAN  P1 P2 ES PL L0 N1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n   This procedure supplies the mesh of a cable suspended at its\n extremities and subjected to its own weight. It also supplies\n the model associated with it and the tension field in the cable.  \n   \n\n   Contents :\n   __________\n\n   P1, P2 : cable extreme points (POINT type)\n\n   ES     : cable membrane-type stiffness (FLOTTANT type)\n\n   PL     : cable lineic weight  (FLOTTANT type)\n\n   L0     : length of the empty cable (FLOTTANT type)\n\n   N1     : number of requested elements (ENTIER type)\n\n   GEO1   : mesh (MAILLAGE type)\n\n   MODL1  : model object (MMODEL type)\n\n   CHEL1  : tension field (MCHAML type)\n\n    Remark : The cable weigth is taken along the negative\n    ______   z direction.\n\n\n \n"
