    "url": "HOMO",
    "documentation": "$$$$ HOMO     NOTICE  GOUNAND   13/01/17    21:15:01     7668           \n                                             DATE     13/01/17\n\n    Operateur HOMOTHETIE                     Voir aussi : AFFI\n    --------------------  \n    GEO1 = GEO2  HOMO  RAPP1 POIN1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ___________\n\n    The HOMOTHETIE operator constructs an object by homothety.\n\n\n    Contents :\n    _________\n\n    GEO2    : initial object (MAILLAGE or POINT type)\n\n    RAPP1   : homothetic ratio  (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    POIN1   : centre of homothety (POINT type)\n\n    GEO1    : generated object (MAILLAGE or POINT type)\n\n    Note :\n    ________\n\n    GEO1 GEO2 ... GEOn   HOMO  RAPP1 POIN1;\n\n    The operation is carried out on n objects simultaneously and\n    has n results. GEO1...GEOn must have the same type (either \n    MAILLAGE or POINT).\n\n    Example :\n    ---------\n        NC1 NC2 NC3 NC4 NS  =  C1 C2 C3 C4 S HOMO 0.3 (10 0) ;\n\n\n \n \n"
