    "url": "HRCAV",
    "documentation": "$$$$ HRCAV    NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:28     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n     Procedure HRCAV                         Voir aussi : RAYE FFOR HRAYO\n     ---------------  \n  CHAM1 = HRCAV MRT EMIS TE TRAD (FLOT1) ;\n                                                                         \n\n     Description :\n     ____________\n\n     This procedure calculates a linearized exchange coefficient for\n the treatment of radiation across a tranparent medium in a cavity.\n\n\n      Contents :\n      _________\n\n     MRT   : radiation model (MMODEL type)\n\n     EMIS  : emissivity field defined on the radiation model\n             (MCHAML type)\n\n     TE    : temperature field defined on the cavity\n             (MCHAML type)\n\n     TRAD  : temperature computed with the RAYE operator, function\n             of the form factors, the emissivity, and the temperature\n             field corresponding to a given iteration (preceeding\n             field)\n             (MCHAML type)\n\n     FLOT1 : Stefan-Boltzmann constant (default value 5.67e-8 Wm-2K-4)\n             (FLOTTANT type)\n                                                                         \n     CHAM1 : exchange coefficient\n             (MCHAML type)\n\n\n \n \n \n"
