    "documentation": "$$$$ H_B      NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:26     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure H_B                        Voir aussi :\n        -------------  \n            EV1 = H_B   FLOT1 (EVO1)  (FLOT2) ;\n            \n\n\n\n        Description : \n        -------------\n\n       In magnetostatics 2D vector potential or 3d scalar potential,\n       the H_B procedure gives the curve mu(h) or 1/(mu(b) depending\n       on whether the potential is scalar (3D) or vector. (2D)\n\n\n       Contents :\n       ----------\n\n       FLOT1   vacuum permeability in coherent unit\n       EVO1    evoltion of iron b(H) curve  abscissa  H  ordinate B\n               if not present a standard curve is provided \n       FLOT2   packing factor  default 1.         \n\n       Output data :\n\n       EV1   evolution, dependence of mu with respect to H or B \n \n\n \n \n"
