    "documentation": "$$$$ IDLI     NOTICE  BP208322  14/09/15    21:16:39     8150           \n                                             DATE     14/09/15\n \n    Operateur IDLI                           Voir aussi : BLOQ DEPI RESO\n    --------------  \n      TAB1 = IDLI  RIG1 GEO1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The IDLI operator builds the TAB1 (TABLE type) object \n    which subtype is LIAISONS_STATIQUES.\n    The components of TAB1 also belong to the TABLE type and\n    each one comprises\n    - one POINT_LIAISON (POINT type), belonging both to the\n    mesh of RIG1 (RIGIDITE type) an to GEO1 (MAILLAGE type)\n    - one DDL_LIAISON (MOT type) describing the degree of \n    freedom associated with in RIG1\n\n\n      Contents :\n      _________\n\n     Given the connectivity, IDLI enables an analysis by\n     sub-structures (for instance Craig-Bampton)\n     (see also BLOQ, DEPI, RESO, dyna14.dgibi)\n \n \n \n"
