    "documentation": "$$$$ IFRE     NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:14     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n                                             \n  Operateur IFRE                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    FLOT1 FLOT2 = IFRE  FLOT3 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The IFRE operator calculates FRESNEL integrals :\n\n                                  / FLOT3\n            FLOT1 = 1/sqrt(2.PI) /       cos(T)/sqrt(T) dT\n                                / 0\n\n                                  / FLOT3\n            FLOT2 = 1/sqrt(2.PI) /       sin(T)/sqrt(T) dT\n                                / 0\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    FLOTi : FLOTTANT type objects\n            FLOT3 is expressed in RADIAN\n\n\n \n \n"
