    "documentation": "$$$$ INDIBETA NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:34     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure INDIBETA                       Voir aussi :\n    ------------------  \n    FLOT4 = INDIBETA FLOT1 FLOT2 FLOT3;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    This procedure calculates the reliability index defined by \n    a probability.\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    FLOT1 = lowest value (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT2 = highest value (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT3 = probability (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT4 = reliability index (FLOTTANT type)\n\n\n \n \n"
