    "url": "INSE",
    "documentation": "$$$$ INSE     NOTICE  FD218221  26/09/21    21:15:05     12652          \n                                             DATE     26/09/21\n\n    Operateur INSERER                  Voir aussi : ENLE REMP\n    -----------------  \n      OBJET3 = INSERER  OBJET1 N1 OBJET2 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The INSERER operator is used to insert the OBJET2 object \n into the OBJET1 object exactly at position N1. The created  \n OBJET3 object has the same type as the OBJET1 object.\n\n    Possible operations :\n    _____________________\n\n    ----------------------------------------------\n    |    OBJET1    |     N1       |    OBJET2    |\n    ----------------------------------------------\n    |   LISTREEL   |   ENTIER     |   FLOTTANT   |\n    |   LISTENTI   |   ENTIER     |   ENTIER     |\n    |   LISTMOTS   |   ENTIER     |   MOT        |\n    |   LISTCHPO   |   ENTIER     |   CHPOINT    |\n    |   LISTOBJE   |   ENTIER     |   OBJET      |\n    ----------------------------------------------\n\n \n \n \n"
