    "documentation": "$$$$ JEU      NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:40     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n    Procedure JEU                            Voir aussi : RELA\n    -------------                                         DEPI  \n    CHPO1 =  JEU   RIG1  ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The JEU procedure is used to calculate the second member\n corresponding to a gap between two solids associated with the \n relations connecting the degrees of freedom of these solids, and  \n conveying their possible contact. \n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    RIG1   : RIGIDITE type object of BLOCAGE subtype defining\n             the relations imposed on the degrees of freedom of the\n             solids.             \n\n    CHPO1  : result (CHPOINT type), which you should add to the second\n             member (forces in mechanics) before doing the solution.\n\n\n \n"
