    "documentation": "$$$$ JONC     NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:15     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n                                             \n  Operateur JONCT                          Voir aussi :\n    ---------------  \n    ATTA1 = JONC  STRU1 MOT1 LREEL1 ...   ( STRU2 MOT2 LREEL2 ... )\n                ( STRU3 MOT3 LREEL3 ... ) ( STRU4 MOT4 LREEL4 ... ) ...\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The JONCT operator creates an ATTACHE type object describing\n the linkage between several structure elements.\n\n    This linkage is defined by any number of elementary linkages.\n   \n    Contents :\n    _________\n\n\n    STRUi  : structure element created by the ELST operator.\n             (ELEMSTRU type)\n\n    MOTi   : name of the unknown at one point of STRUi (MOT type),\n             to be chosen from the displacements UX, UY, or UZ,\n             the rotations RX, RY or RZ, the forces FX, FY or FZ,\n             and the moments MX, MY or MZ\n\n    LREELi : list of the coefficients applied at the points of\n             STRUi (as many coefficients as there are points) \n             (LISTREEL type)\n             If STRUi contains a single point, the LREELi may be\n             replaced with a FLOTTANT (floating)\n\n\n \n \n"
