    "documentation": "$$$$ KFPT     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:16:43     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n      Operateur  K FPT                        Voir aussi : FPT ou FPU\n      ---------------  \n      Syntaxe :\n      ---------\n\n        H = KFPT $mod RO MU CP LB UET YP\n\n\n\n\n    APPLICATION FIELD : turbulent Thermo-hydraulics.\n    ------------------           \n             \n                  \n     DESCRIPTION :\n     -------------                  \n               \n   Standard-wall functions associated with the K-E model for\n   the Temperature variable (TN).\n                    \n   H      Heat Exchange coefficient               CHPOINT SCAL SOMMET\n                                                                                \n                 \n      USE :                                                             \n      -----                                                           \n                                                                                \n\n     The UET friction velocity usually comes from the FPU operator.\n     Give preference to a limiting value YP for the distance from the wall\n     such as its dimentionless value Y+ be ranged between 30 and 300 \n     when performing the calculations.\n                                                                                \n                                                                                \n       \n                                                                                \n                                                                                \n     POSSIBLE COEFFICIENTS\n     ---------------------\n                                                                                \n                                                                                \n  RO     density                                 FLOTTANT or SCAL SOMMET\n                                                                                \n  MU     molecular dynamic viscosity             FLOTTANT or SCAL SOMMET\n                                                                                \n  CP     specific heat capacity                  FLOTTANT or SCAL SOMMET\n                                                                                \n  LB     thermal conductivity                    FLOTTANT or SCAL SOMMET\n                                                                                \n  UET    Friction velocity                       CHPOINT SCAL SOMMET\n\n  YP     distance from the wall                  FLOTTANT\n                                                                                \n\n\n\n \n \n \n"
