    "name": "MADEF3D",
    "url": "MADEF3D",
    "documentation": "$$$$ MADEF3D  NOTICE  JK148537  26/06/29    21:15:01     12588          \n                                             DATE     26/06/29\n\n    Procedure MADEF3D               Voir aussi : TRAC3D\n    ----------------  \n  GEO2  |=  MADEF3D  GEO1 CHPO1 N1 MOT1 (FLOT1) (N2) (FLOT2) ;\n  CHPO2 |\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    This procedure enables in DIME 3 option the construction of\n    a 3D mesh or a field based upon this 3D mesh, starting from\n    a mesh uniquely composed of SEG2 elements (coor 1 -> R, \n    coor 3 -> Z) and a axisymmetrical or Fourier field.\n\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n   GEO1  : 3D mesh (MAILLAGE type), element SEG2\n\n   CHPO1 : field build in axisymmetrical or \n           MODE FOURIER NN option (CHPOINT type) based upon GEO1\n\n   N1    : number of FOURIER harmonic (ENTIER type) \n           (0 : axisymmetrical)\n   \n   MOT1 : 'MAILLAGE','DEFORMEE' or 'FORCES' (MOT type)\n\n   FLOT1 : rotational amplitude in degrees to build the 3D mesh\n           default value 360. (FLOTTANT type)\n\n   N2    : subdivison of this amplitude (ENTIER type),\n           default value 10\n\n   FLOT2 : amplification of CHPO1 components (FLOTTANT type)\n           default value 1.d0\n           \n   GEO2 : 3D mesh (maillage type), elements TRI3 ou QUA4\n   \n   CHPO2 : field (type CHPOINT) with cartesian components\n           based upon GEO2\n  \n\n$$$$\n \n \n"
