    "name": "MEC1",
    "url": "MEC1",
    "documentation": "$$$$ MEC1     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:13     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n  Voir aussi :\n            ELASTIC CALCULATION IN MECHANICAL ANALYSIS\n            ------------------------------------------\n\n List of objects manipulated within the context of an elastic \n calculation in mechanics :\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  MMODEL   : f.e. formulation and behavior model                     |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  MCHAML   : field defined within the elements                       |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  CHPOINT  : field defined at the mesh nodes                         |  \n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  DEFORME  : mesh deformed by a displacement field                   |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  ENTIER   : integer                                                 | \n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  FLOTTANT : floating number                                         |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  LISTENTI : list of integers (LECT operator)                        |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  LISTREEL : list of real numbers (PROG operator)                    |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  LOGIQUE  : logical variable (true-false)                           |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  MAILLAGE : geometry of the studied structure                       |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  MOT      : word                                                    |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  RIGIDITE : stiffness and restraint matrix                          |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  SOLUTION : eigen mode family                                       |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n|  VECTEUR  : deflections (to be plotted)                             |\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\\015\n\n\n\n \n"
