    "documentation": "$$$$ MULC     NOTICE  GOUNAND   12/12/06    21:15:16     7595           \n                                             DATE     12/12/06\n\n    Procedure MULC                           Voir aussi : *\n    --------------  \n    CH1 = MULC CH2 CH3 ;\n\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n \n    The MULC procedure multiplies 2 fields by points, term by term.\n\n    Contents :\n    ___________\n \n    CH2, CH3  : fields (CHPOINT type) associated with the same\n                geometry; they have the same names of\n                components\n\n    CH1       : field (CHPOINT type) associated with the same\n                geometry ; it has the same names of components \n                as CH2 and CH3; the value of the component Cj \n                at the point Pi of the field CH1 equals the \n                product of the values of the fields CH2 and CH3 \n                for the same component and at the same point.      \n                        \n    Note :\n    ________\n\n    The MULC procedure is called on by the SISSIB procedure.\n\n    It is advised to use the more general '*' operator.\n\n\n \n \n"
