    "documentation": "$$$$ NBEL     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:21     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n    Operateur NBEL                           Voir aussi : ELEM\n    --------------                                        NBNO  \n    RESU1 = NBEL  GEO1 (LMOTS1) ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The NBEL operator supplies the number of elements contained in\n a geometry. The research may be restricted to certain type(s) of\n element(s) and the result is therefore the number of elements of\n each requested type.\n \n\n     Contents :\n     _________\n \n    GEO1   : geometry (MAILLAGE type)\n\n    LMOTS1 : list of the types of elements (LISTMOTS type)\n\n    RESU1  : number of elements contained in the geometry (ENTIER type)\n             list of the numbers of elements corresponding to the\n             requested types (LISTENTI type)\n\n    Example :\n    _________\n\n    LIST (NBEL MONOBJ1); for getting to know the number of elements of\n                         the MONOBJ1 object \n\n\n\n \n"
