    "name": "NEUT",
    "url": "NEUT",
    "documentation": "$$$$ NEUT     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:22     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n  \n  Operateur NEUT                            Voir aussi :\n   --------------  \n       CHPO2 = NEUT  TAB1  CHPO1  ;\n\n\n     Description :\n     -------------\n     The NEUT operator allow the calculation of electric balance\n      in aqueous systems.\n\n     Contents:\n     ---------\n\n       TAB1 is a TABLE type object, subtype CHIMI1. (cf operator CHI1)\n\n\n       CHPO1 is a CHPOIN type object. Contains a component for each\n             soluble chemical species. Contains the species \n             concentration in solution.\n\n       CHPO2 is a CHPOIN type object. Contains two components ANIO and\n             CATI\n             ANIO contains the concentration in anions.\n             CATI contains the concentration in cations.\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n"
