    "url": "PAS_MODL",
    "documentation": "$$$$ PAS_MODL NOTICE  PASCAL    22/04/13    21:15:03     11339          \n                                             DATE     22/04/13\n\n\n    Procedure PAS_MODL   \n    ------------------\n\n    \n    PAS_MODL TAB1 ;\n\n    \n    Description :\n    -------------\n\n    This procedure is internal procedure of PASAPAS.\n    It initializes and updates the indexes relative to the models\n    in the PASAPAS sub-table WTABLE, as well as the indexes relative \n    to their characteristics.\n\n    \n    Contents :\n    ----------\n\n    TAB1 is the data input table of PASAPAS.\n\n\n    INPUTS :\n    --------\n\n    PAS_MODL uses the following index of TAB1:\n\n    TAB1.WTABLE.'MODELE'           : MMODEL type object, by default,\n                                     the PASAPAS model (TAB1.'MODELE')\n\n    TAB1.WTABLE.'CARACTERISTIQUES' : MCHAML type object, model\n                                     characteristics (by default,\n                                     TAB1.'CARACTERISTIQUES')\n\n\n    OUTPUTS :\n    ---------\n\n    PAS_MODL initializes or updates the following index of TAB1:\n\n\n    TAB1.WTABLE.'MODELE_COURANT' : MMODEL type object, model used by\n                                   the procedure the last call to set\n                                   the output table.\n\n\n    For the other outputs, see the french manual page.\n                                   ------------------\n\n\n\n$$$$\n\n    \n \n \n \n \n"
