    "documentation": "$$$$ PAVE     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:35     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur PAVE                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    VOL1 = PAVE  SURF1 SURF2 SURF3 SURF4 SURF5 SURF6 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The PAVE operator enables the user to mesh, with cubes,\n the inside of a parallelepiped whose 6 faces are specified.\n \n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    SURFi : faces fixing the limits of the volume (MAILLAGE type)\n\n    VOL1  : generated volume (MAILLAGE type)\n\n    Note :\n    ________\n\n    The faces must be rectangular, meshed with quadrilaterals\n by means of the DALLER operator.\n\n    The opposite faces that must be in order in the list, must\n have equivalent descriptions.\n\n \n"
