    "documentation": "$$$$ PECHE    NOTICE  SP204843  26/03/10    21:15:09     12488          \n                                             DATE     26/03/10\n\n    Procedure PECHE                          Voir aussi : NONLIN\n    ---------------                                       PASAPAS  \n    CH2 = PECHE  TAB1 MOT1 ( FLOT1 ) ( MOT2 ) ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    This procedure enables the user to retreive for a given\n time the results of a calculation carried out using the NONLIN \n or PASAPAS procedure. \n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    TAB1  : table used in NONLIN or PASAPAS (TABLE type)\n\n    MOT1  : key word (MOT type) corresponding to the requested\n            result index (for instance : 'RESUDEPL', 'DEPLACEMENTS'...)\n\n    FLOT1 : time (FLOTTANT type) for which the results are requested.\n            By default, the results for the last calculated time will\n            be retreived.\n            \n    MOT2  : key word (MOT type) 'IPOL' to interpolate the results at\n            a time which is not among the calculated time steps.\n            Allows extrapolation beyond the bounds of the time steps.\n            Returns the result at the bounds in this latter case.\n\n    CH2   : generated field (CHPOINT or MCHAML type)\n$$$$\n\n \n \n \n"
