    "documentation": "$$$$ PERM     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:35     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur PERMEABILITE                   Voir aussi :\n    ----------------------  \n      RIG1 = PERM MODL1 MAT1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The PERM operator calculates the permeability matrices of elements\n in porous medium .\n\n\n      Contents :\n      __________\n\n\n      MODL1 : model object (MMODEL type)\n\n      MAT1  : field of material properties (MCHAML type, CARACTERISTIQUES\n              subtype) \n              \n      RIG1  : permeability matrices\n              (RIGIDITE type, PERMEABILITE subtype)\n\n\n    Notes :\n    _________\n\n    The geometrical support of RIG1 will be that of MAT1.\n\n    The harmonic number used in a Fourier series analysis is\n specified by the following instruction :\n\n                    OPTION MODE FOUR NN ;\n\n \n"
