    "name": "PHAJ",
    "url": "PHAJ",
    "documentation": "$$$$ PHAJ     NOTICE  CB215821  21/08/20    21:15:32     11089          \n                                             DATE     21/08/20\n\n    Operateur PHAJ                           Voir aussi : PMAT PROP\n    --------------                                        EXCP EXCS  \n      CHP2 =  PHAJ  MOD1 MAT1 CHP1 ;\n\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The 'PHAJ' operator computes the \"gap\" associated with unilateral\nconditions to drive thermal change of phase.\nThis operator is automatically called by TRANSNON procedure.\n\n\n      Contents :\n      _________\n\n      MOD1  : MMODEL type objet containing a 'CHANGEMENT_PHASE' formulation.\n\n      MAT1 :  MCHAML type objet representing material datas. The 'PRIM'\n              componentis expected to be constant for each SUB-MODEL.\n\n      CHP1  : CHPOINT type objet containing initial values of unknowns.\n\n      CHP2  : CHPOINT type objet containing the \"gaps\" of unknowns ('FLX')\n              before the beginning of the phase change.\n\n$$$$\n\n\n \n"
