    "documentation": "$$$$ PREPAENC NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:43     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                                                                \n  Procedure PREPAENC                       Voir aussi :\n    ------------------  \n      PREPAENC RXT TBT ;\n\n\n                                                                                \n                                                                                \n     Description :\n     _____________\n\n The PREPAENC procedure is an internal procedur called by ENCEINTE.\n\n     Contents :\n     __________\n\n    RXT   TABLE  :\n    TBT   TABLE  :\n\n \n \n"
