    "name": "PROBABRS",
    "url": "PROBABRS",
    "documentation": "$$$$ PROBABRS NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:44     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure PROBABRS                       Voir aussi :\n    ------------------  \n    FLOT9 = PROBABRS FLOT1 FLOT2 FLOT3 FLOT4 \n                     FLOT5 FLOT6 FLOT7 FLOT8 \n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    This procedure calculates the failure probability of an idealized\n    component reliability problem :\n             Prob(R<S)\n    Probability that the resistance (R) is less than\n                  the internal load (S)\n \n    (Resistance and internal load are defined by their first four\n     statistical moments)\n\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    FLOT1 : Resistance's Mean (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT2 : Resistance's Standard deviation (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT3 : Resistance's Skewness (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT4 : Resistance's Kurtosis (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT5 : Sollicitation's Mean (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT6 : Sollicitation's Standard deviation (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT7 : Sollicitation's Skewness (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT8 : Sollicitation's Kurtosis (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT9 : Probability that R < S (FLOTTANT type)  \n\n\n \n \n"
