    "documentation": "$$$$ PROBDENS NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:44     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Procedure PROBDENS                       Voir aussi :\n    ------------------  \n    EVOL1 EVOL2 = PROBDENS FLOT1 FLOT2 FLOT3 FLOT4\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    This procedure calculates the probability density function\n    and the cumulative density function in \n      [mu-6*sigma,mu+6*sigma].\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    FLOT1 = mean (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT2 = standard deviation (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT3 = skewness (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    FLOT4 = kurtosis (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    EVOL1 = probability density function (EVOLUTION type)\n\n    EVOL2 = cumulative density function (EVOLUTION type)\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n"
