    "name": "PRRA",
    "url": "PRRA",
    "documentation": "$$$$ PRRA     NOTICE  AM        14/07/22    21:15:01     8047           \n                                             DATE     14/07/22\n\n \n  Operateur PRRA                           Voir aussi : \n    --------------  \n      TAB1 =  PRRA  MOD1 ;\n                                \n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The PRRA operator set a TABLE object which can be processed by the \n    CHARTHER procedur in order to modelize the thermal radiationt\n\n\n\n      Contents :\n      _________\n\n      MOD1 : MODEL object of \"thermique rayonnement\" type\n      \n      TAB1 : TABLE object with indexes from 1 to N for the N independent\n      conditions of thermal radiation.\n\n$$$$\n \n \n \n"
