    "url": "PSATT",
    "documentation": "$$$$ PSATT    NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:46     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                                                                \n  Procedure PSATT                          Voir aussi :\n    ---------------  \n      P = PSATT T ;\n\n\n                                                                                \n                                                                                \n     Description :\n     _____________\n\n The PSATT procedure computes the partial pressure of steam for a\n saturation temperature T.\n\n     Comments :\n     __________\n\n   T    : Steam Temperature (en K)\n  may be CHPOINT, or FLOTTANT or LISTREEL.\n\n   P    : PSAT(T) (in Pa)\n\n \n \n"
