    "documentation": "$$$$ QULX     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:49     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur QULX                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    CHPO1 = QULX  RIG1 CHPO2 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The QULX operator is used for the unilateral support procedure\n  only. It extracts the Lagrangian multipliers existing in a stiffness\n  matrix from a field by points. The nature of the field by points is\n 'discret'.\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    RIG1  : stiffness matrix (RIGIDITE type)\n\n    CHPO2 : field by point (CHPOINT type) containing Lagrange's\n            multipliers\n\n    CHPO1 : Lagrangian multipliers (CHPOINT type)\n\n \n"
