    "url": "REFE",
    "documentation": "$$$$ REFE     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:54     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n  Operateur REFE                          Voir aussi :\n     --------------  \n\n\n\n     DESCRIPTION : List the mesh objects defined by nodes in another\n     ------------  object or indicate whether a mesh object is included\n                   in another object.\n\n     SYNTAX 1 : LOBI =  REFE OBJ2 ;\n     ------\n                 LOBI : LISTMOTS object containing the list\n\n\n\n     SYNTAX 2 : LOGI = OBJ1 REFE OBJ2 ;\n     ------\n                 LOGI : LOGIQUE type object with VRAI (true) or FAUX  \n                        (false) value depending on whether OBJ1 is \n                        included in OBJ2 or not\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n"
