    "documentation": "$$$$ RESI     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:57     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur RESI                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    RIG1 = RESI MOD1 MAT1;\n\n\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The RESI operator calculates the resistance matrix of a \n    'MAGNETODYNAMIQUE' model with a 'POTENTIEL_VECTEUR' formulation.\n\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n     MOD1  : name of the 'MAGNETODYNAMIQUE' model (type MODELE)\n     MAT1  : characteristic field of the material (type MCHAML)\n     RIG1  : resistance matrix (type RIGIDITE)\n \n \n"
