    "documentation": "$$$$ REST     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:17:59     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n    Directive RESTITUER                      Voir aussi : SAUV\n    -------------------                        \n    RESTITUER ( 'FORMAT'     )      ;\n              ( 'LABEL' CHA1 )\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The RESTITUER instruction is used to restore to memory the\n objects described in the file bearing the IORES1 logical number\n defined as follows :\n\n           OPTION REST IORES1 ;\n\n    If the \"label\" is given the restitution from the file will stop\nat the end of the part named with this label.\n\n    Note :\n    ________\n\n    The FORMAT option should be used only if the file is a formatted\n one.\n\n   To give an empty label or to skip it leads to read the whole file.\n\n   If you did several calculations with the same mesh, you may merge\n them using simultaneously the OPTION NBP NPT instruction.\n\n    CAUTION :\n    _________\n\n    It is recommanded that this instruction head the data file, \n especially if you wish to create new points.\n But first, you will have to redefine the OPTIONs.\n\n \n\n \n \n"
