    "name": "RFCO",
    "url": "RFCO",
    "documentation": "$$$$ RFCO     NOTICE  OF166741  26/05/06    21:15:07     12541          \n                                             DATE     26/05/06\n\n\n    Operateur RFCO\n    -------------\n\n       R1  F1  =  RFCO  MOD1 LOG1  CHEL1 ;\n\n\n\n    Description:\n    ____________\n\n    This operator computes stiffness matrix for 'CONTACT' or 'CONTRAINTE' formulation.\n    It also computes second member.\n\n\n    Contents:\n    _________\n\n      MOD1  : MODELE object with 'CONTACT' or 'CONTRAINTE' formulation\n\n      LOG1  : False in non convergence situation\n\n      CHEL1 : MCHAML field of model properties\n\n\n      R1    : Stiffness matrix (or integer 0)\n\n      F1    : CHPOINT of Lagrange multiplier containing second member (or integer 0)\n\n\n      Comments: This operator is invoked by the PASAPAS procedure to update conditions during the computation.\n\n$$$$\n\n \n"
