    "documentation": "$$$$ RIMP     NOTICE  FANDEUR   21/12/15    21:15:08     10824          \n                                             DATE     21/12/15\n                                             \n  Operateur RIMP                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n    EVOL2  =  RIMP  EVOL1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The RIMP operator changes the subtypes of a complex object of EVOLUTION type.\n\n    If the type of the object EVOL1 is 'PREE' 'PIMA' (real part, imaginary part), \n EVOL2 will be 'MODU' 'PHAS' type (modulus, phase) and vice-versa.\n\n \n"
