    "url": "SAUF",
    "documentation": "$$$$ SAUF     NOTICE  JC220346  14/12/09    21:15:12     8315           \n                                             DATE     14/12/09\n                                             \n  Operateur SAUF                           Voir aussi :\n    --------------  \n            LIST3 = LIST1 SAUF LIST2 (| FLOT1  |) ;\n                                      | 'NOCA' |\n\n    Description :\n    ____________\n\n    The SAUF operator creates the list LIST3 from the elements of \n    the list LIST1 which are not in the list LIST2.\n\n    The lists can be LISTENTI, LISTREEL or LISTMOTS objects.\n    \n    For LISTREEL, FLOT1 (FLOTTANT type) can be provided as an absolute\n    criterion to assess the equality of two real numbers.\n    \n    For LISTMOTS, adding the keyword 'NOCA' makes the operation case\n    insensitive.\n\n \n \n"
