    "url": "SILAM",
    "documentation": "$$$$ SILAM    NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:18:06     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n    Procedure SILAM                          Voir aussi : @LAREAD\n    ---------------                                       @LACALC  \n    SILAM TAB_LAM DEPL1 NZON VET1 P0 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    ------------\n\n    This procedure makes it possible to display the stress variation \n    in relation to the thickness with respect to a requested point.\n\n    Input data :\n\n    TAB_LAM  characteristics table of the multilayer\n    DEPL1    displacement field\n    NZON     number of the requested region\n    VET1     orientation direction of the stress field\n    P0       point for which we want to display the stresses\n\n\n \n"
