    "url": "SOLS",
    "documentation": "$$$$ SOLS     NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:25     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n                                             \n    Operateur SOLS                           \n    --------------\n\n    SOL1 = SOLS  ATTA1 STRU1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The SOLS operator creates static solutions U for all of the\n permanent linkages of ATTA1 that apply to the STRU structure \n    They can be :\n\n                 - either linkages connected with free nodes,\n  in this case, U resolves :  KU + Pt = 0\n\n                 - or linckages connected with restrained nodes,\n  in this case, U is obtained by imposing a unit displacement on \n  the linkage nodes\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n\n    SOL1   : generated object (SOLUTION type, SOLUSTAT subtype)\n\n    STRU1  : basic structure (STRUCTURE type)\n\n    ATTA1  : set of permanent linkages (ATTACHE type)\n\n \n \n"
