    "name": "TOPODYDX",
    "url": "TOPODYDX",
    "documentation": "$$$$ TOPODYDX NOTICE  FD218221  25/12/18    21:15:05     12429          \n                                             DATE     25/12/18\n\n\n\n    Procedure TOPODYDX                       See also: TOPOPTIM\n    __________________\n\n\nThis procedure is called by TOPOPTIM to calculate chained partial derivatives\nwhen there are intermediate optimization variables.\nHere, the procedure multiplies a sensitivity field by the partial derivative\nof the physical densities with respect to the design variables.\nThe partial derivative is calculated using the chain rule.\n\n\n$$$$\n \n"
