    "documentation": "$$$$ VERS     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:18:31     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur VERSENS                        Voir aussi :\n    -----------------  \n    GEO2 = VERSENS  GEO1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The VERSENS operator is the identity operator on the GEO1 \n object (MAILLAGE type). However, it displays an error if two \n adjacent elements in GEO1 are oriented differently.\n\n \n"
