    "documentation": "$$$$ VITEUNIL NOTICE  MB234859  17/10/02    21:15:29     9577           \n                                             DATE     17/10/02\n\n  procedure VITEUNIL                       Voir aussi :\n    ------------------  \n\n    This procedure is called on by the dynamic procedures\n (NEWMARK, NONLIN) so as to adjust the velocities in case\n of unilateral supports.\n\n \n \n"
