    "name": "XTMX",
    "url": "XTMX",
    "documentation": "$$$$ XTMX     NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:18:35     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n\n    Operateur XTMX                           Voir aussi : YTMX, XTX, XTY\n    --------------  \n    FLOT1 = XTMX  CHPO1 RIG1 ;\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The XTMX operator calculates the quadratic form application \n associated with a stiffness and a field by points.\n\n    Contents :\n    _________\n\n    CHPO1 : field by points (CHPOINT type)\n\n    RIG1  : stiffness matrix (RIGIDITE type)\n\n    FLOT1 : generated object (FLOTTANT type)\n\n\n    Remark : \n    The transposition rule which associates the primal unknown X\n    to the dual unknown MX uses the names defined in bdata (CCHAMP)\n    (leading to the calculation of : UX*FX + UY*FY + ...). \n    The use of another rule is possible by using the following syntax :\n    flot1 = XTY chpo1 (Rig1 * chpo1) lmot1 lmot2;\n    where lmot1 and lmot2 are LISTMOTS defined by user.\n\n \n \n"
