    "name": "XTX",
    "url": "XTX",
    "documentation": "$$$$ XTX      NOTICE  CHAT      11/09/12    21:18:35     7124           \n                                             DATE     11/09/12\n                                             \n  Operateur XTX                            Voir aussi :\n    -------------  \n    FLOT3 = XTX  | CH1                  |  ;\n                 |                      |\n                 | FLOT1 CH1  FLOT2 CH2 |\n\n\n    Description :\n    _____________\n\n    The XTX operator calculates the norm of a field or of the linear \n combination of two fields of same type.\n\n    Contents :\n    __________\n\n    CH1 |   : fields to be mormed (MCHAML or CHPOINT type)\n    CH2 |\n\n    FLOT1 | : multiplying coefficients (FLOTTANT type)\n    FLOT2 |\n\n    FLOT3   : norm of the field CH1 (FLOTTANT type)\n\n    Note :\n    ________\n\n    This norm is the sum of the squares of all the components at \n every point. The result FLOT3 is of FLOTTANT type.\n\n \n"
